312575,CSP-20-3018,mohammad,Casino Supply 18 Inch Abs Roulette Wheel: Steel Spinner,Casino Supply 18 Inch Abs Roulette Wheel: Steel Spinner,9,139,0,,"* If you are looking for a professional style wheel on a budget, this 18 Inch ABS Acrylic Wheel - Steel Spinner is for you (includes two professional roulette balls.<br /> <EOL>* Our 18 inch ABS wheel uses the same professional metal spinner as the 19 inch wood wheel.<br /> <EOL>* This wheel is perfectly suited for casino night companies and home game rooms alike.<br /> <EOL>* This wheel can be flush mounted or set on top of your table.<br /> <EOL>* Packed securely in a full color retail box.<br /> <EOL>* This is the best quality wheel you can buy without spending at least twice the money!<br /> <EOL>* It is quality manufactured of a tough high-gloss ABS plastic for high volume use.<br /> <EOL>* The wheel is professionally balanced and mounted on a steel linear ball bearing movement for smooth, reliable action!<br /> <EOL>* This is the same action and same 10"" cast aluminum spinner as used on our 19"" Mahogany Wheel.<br /> <EOL>* This wheel features multi-color ball pockets, chrome plated spinner and quality built to last!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56019,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Roulette Supplies/Roulette Wheels,,131.690,,Friday 13 June 2014 11:34:14 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,104.250,63,N,222,Casino Supply
