312544,CSP-33-0005,mohammad,Casino Supply Ace of Clubs Poker Card Guard Spinner,Casino Supply Ace of Clubs Poker Card Guard Spinner,0.080,6.850,0,,"* This is our premium quality gold plated, solid brass Ace of Clubs Poker Card Guard Spinner.<br /> <EOL>* This 1.625 inch diameter card guard spinner is enclosed in a 2 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker.<br /> <EOL>* The detailed graphics are embedded in the spinner then covered with a clear laminate to prevent fading or wear during the life of this product and protect it against any spills or moisture.<br /> <EOL>* The eye-catching colorful artwork is HAND PAINTED on each piece, giving it a one-of-a-kind quality.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the card guard over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* When your opponents take too long to decide what to bet you can pass the time by spinning this card guard spinner.<br /> <EOL>* There is a small raised dot on the bottom of this spinner which allows you to spin it like a top.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!<br /> <EOL>* The perfect gift for any poker fan!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,6.990,,Friday 13 June 2014 11:39:51 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,5.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
