312559,CSP-33-0002,mohammad,Casino Supply Bullets Poker Card Guard Spinner,Casino Supply Bullets Poker Card Guard Spinner,0.080,6.850,0,,"* This is our premium quality gold plated, solid brass Bullets Poker Card Guard Spinner.<br /> <EOL>* Artwork on our Bullets spinner is a beautifully detailed with one of the strongest starting hands in Texas HoldEm a Pair of Aces (""Bullets"").<br /> <EOL>* This 1.625 inch diameter card guard spinner is enclosed in a 2 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker.<br /> <EOL>* The detailed graphics are embedded in the spinner then covered with a clear laminate to prevent fading or wear during the life of this product and protect it against any spills or moisture.<br /> <EOL>* The eye-catching colorful artwork is HAND PAINTED on each piece, giving it a one-of-a-kind quality.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the card guard over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* When your opponents take too long to decide what to bet you can pass the time by spinning this card guard spinner.<br /> <EOL>* There is a small raised dot on the bottom of this spinner which allows you to spin it like a top.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!<br /> <EOL>* The perfect gift for any poker fan!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,6.990,,Friday 13 June 2014 09:11:32 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,5.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313091,CSP-50-0055,ariel2,Casino Supply Camie Fast Tack Poker Table Spray Adhesive for Foam,Casino Supply Camie Fast Tack Poker Table Spray Adhesive for Foam,0.980,8.950,0,,"* Camie Fast Tack Upholstery Adhesive is especially formulated to bond polyurethane foam, latex foam, polyethylene foam, supported vinyls and fabrics to themselves or to metals, wood, etc.<br /> <EOL>* Camie 313 has a web spray pattern that offers low soak-in, instant tack, is clear, and develops flexible bonds that are either temporary or permanent.<br /> <EOL>* (Comparable to 3M Product #74) No air shipping allowed on this product.<br /> <EOL>* Suggested Application Technique<br /> <EOL>* Hold can 6-8 inches away from surface and apply a uniform coating.<br /> <EOL>* For permanent bonds, apply to both surfaces, allow to dry for approx.<br /> <EOL>* 30-60 seconds and firmly press substrates together.<br /> <EOL>* For temporary bonds, apply to one surface only, allow to dry for approx.<br /> <EOL>* 30 seconds and firmly press substrates together.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Aerosol Tech Specs:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Container Size: 12 oz Net Wt.<br /> <EOL>* Color: Translucent<br /> <EOL>* Spray Pattern: Web Spray<br /> <EOL>* Bond Type: Temporary or Permanent (1 or 2 side application)<br /> <EOL>* Heat Resistance (Continuous): 130 Degrees F.<br /> <EOL>* Bonding Time Range (Approx): one surface 7 Seconds to 2 Hours / two surfaces 10 Seconds to 5 minutes<br /> <EOL>* Solvent Type: Hexane, Acetone",,1000000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,9.730,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 05:40:31 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,7.160,63,N,222,Casino Supply
