312842,CSP-50-0072,mohammad,"Casino Supply Casino Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth: Sold per Running Foot, Royal Blue",Casino Supply Casino Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth,0.500,3.850,0,,"* Beautiful diamond Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth at a low discount price for your game room table.<br /> <EOL>* Build your table with the best cloth available.<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth is the number one choice for poker table felt used today!<br /> <EOL>* This is the best poker cloth if you want durability and playability!<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth will last the life of your table.<br /> <EOL>* There will be no need to replace your poker table felt every couple of months like some other poker cloths; our fabric is treated with a super waterproofing agent.<br /> <EOL>* Liquids just bead up on the fabric, they do not soak in.<br /> <EOL>* Any spills are easily cleaned up.<br /> <EOL>* Our cloth has an extremely soft feel and fights tough stains to provide lasting beauty and longevity.- sold by the running foot 60 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* For example if you purchase 3 units, you'll receive a piece of cloth 36 inches long by 59 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* An entire roll is 50 yards long.<br /> <EOL>* We offer the suited speed cloth in several colors.<br /> <EOL>* For those of you who want the ultimate custom poker cloth, we offer Dye Sublimated poker table felt customized to your exact specifications.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Pattern:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Features a repeating Heart, Diamond, Spade, and Club pattern to them.<br /> <EOL>* Each Heart, Diamond, Spade and Club is inside a repeating diamond shaped outline that is 1 1/4"" Inch x 1 1/4"" Inch Square.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* 59 inches wide (sold by the running foot)<br /> <EOL>* High definition with bright colors<br /> <EOL>* Suited pattern<br /> <EOL>* 100% Polyester<br /> <EOL>* Water Resistant - There is no need to treat this cloth with any other fabric protectors!<br /> <EOL>* Extremely durable<br /> <EOL>* Retains its natural softness<br /> <EOL>* PLEASE NOTE: This product is cut to order and cannot be returned for a refund",,999993,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56029,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Poker Cloth,,3.930,,Sunday 15 June 2014 09:14:10 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.890,63,N,222,Casino Supply
