312662,CSP-60-6511SP,mohammad,Casino Supply Chuck A Seven Spanish Custom Professional Casinotek&reg; Synthetic Digital Layout,Casino Supply Chuck A Seven Spanish Custom Professional Casinotek&reg;,5.640,85,0,,"* This is our Chuck A Seven Spanish Professional CasinoTek Casino Quality Synthetic Digital Layout which has a luxurious feel similar to suede, but more durable than natural material like wool.<br /> <EOL>* We are not a distributor Â? we manufacture each piece in-house.<br /> <EOL>* All of our premium CasinoTek layouts are treated to be both water and stain resistant plus fire retardant.<br /> <EOL>* Digital synthetic layouts are the highest quality professional gaming layouts available.<br /> <EOL>* These layouts are extremely durable with UV resistant brilliant digital full color eye-caching graphics.<br /> <EOL>* Our reputation for ""quick"" turn around time is unmatched in the industry.<br /> <EOL>* Standard layout size is approximately 52 x 78 inches outside and 22 x 41 inches inside<br /> <EOL>* Note: Years of experience in designing table layouts allow us to create stunning one-of-a-kind designs to meet the needs of each customer.<br /> <EOL>* The picture above is our standard design.<br /> <EOL>* We will work with you to tweak or completely redesign the game to meet your needs.<br /> <EOL>* Please let us know what you would like to change in the ""design notes"" section above.<br /> <EOL>* We will put together a full color design proof and email it to you (usually within 48 hours) for your review.<br /> <EOL>* Feel free to make any changes, suggestions, or comments regarding the design.<br /> <EOL>* Once you approve the design, we will start printing and usually ship within 3 business days of the art approval.<br /> <EOL>* PROUDLY MADE IN THE U.S.A.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56026,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Clearance Casino Layouts,,98.250,,Saturday 14 June 2014 11:46:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,76.500,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312130,CSP-50-1010,ariel2,"Casino Supply Chuck-A-Luck 10 Inch Cage, Dice & Laydown","Casino Supply Chuck-A-Luck 10 Inch Cage, Dice & Laydown",4.820,29.850,0,,"* Our Chuck-A-Luck 10 inch Cage, Dice & Laydown comes fully equipped featuring a stainless steel cage, felt lay-down, dice and a quick release top to exchange dice when needed.<br /> <EOL>* Made of precision-crafted stainless steel wire, our cages are among the most durable available.<br /> <EOL>* Each cage is lined on the top and bottom with casino green felt.<br /> <EOL>* Chuck-a-luck is played with three standard dice that are kept in a device shaped somewhat like an hourglass that resembles a wire-frame bird cage and pivots about its center.<br /> <EOL>* The dealer rotates the cage end over end, with the dice landing on the bottom.<br /> <EOL>* Wagers are placed based on possible combinations that can appear on the three dice.<br /> <EOL>* Bets can be that a certain number will come up on one die, (if using the basic enclosed layout) that the three dice will total a certain number, or that the total will be an odd number, even number, a high number, or a low number (shown on professional layout (60-6511s) when the cage stops spinning.<br /> <EOL>* Same set-up less one die can be used for over and under with our professional over and under layout 60-6513s.<br /> <EOL>* Chuck-A-Luck is a popular game at carnivals, fund raisers and many first-class casinos around the world.<br /> <EOL>* It's fun and easy to learn, so beginners take to it quickly, yet the simple premise offers the excitement and high payout that keeps seasoned players coming back for more.<br /><br /> <EOL><b> Measures: </b><br /> <EOL>* 10 inches high when upright<br /> <EOL>* Base measures 6 x 6 inches<br /> <EOL>* Felt layout dimensions: 6 x 31 inches<br /> <EOL>* All steel cage<br /> <EOL>* 3 dice included<br /> <EOL>* Felt layout included",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56011,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Chuck-A-Luck Supplies,,27.290