312286,CSP-60-0002,ariel2,Casino Supply Craps Strategy Card,Casino Supply Craps Strategy Card,0.010,2.850,0,,"* Start saving money by using our Craps Strategy Card and start maximizing your odds, playing with perfect strategy, by making smart bets on every roll of the dice.<br /> <EOL>* Our card provides the craps player with a playing strategy that will keep the House Advantage to about 1% or less.<br /> <EOL>* Our strategy cards make a perfect unique and highly useful gift for yourself or anyone you know who enjoys gambling and wants to win more.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Craps - Side 1</b><br /> <EOL>* Our strategy card provides an easy to follow craps plan which will maximize your odds and have you playing with perfect strategy minimizing the house edge.<br /> <EOL>* The card tells you which bets to make according to those bets which have the lowest house percentage.<br /> <EOL>* Also noted are which bets never to make under any circumstances shown by the houses odds being over 10%.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Craps - Side 2</b><br /> <EOL>* This side of the craps strategy card contains a dice reference chart, showing a pictorial of a craps layout and where all the different bets are placed and what the bets are called.<br /><br /> <EOL><b> Strategy Card Features: </b><br /> <EOL>* Maximize your odds / Minimize the house edge<br /> <EOL>* Make the statistically correct decision every time<br /> <EOL>* Legal to use in land based casinos<br /> <EOL>* Double sided in vibrant color<br /> <EOL>* Professionally printed<br /> <EOL>* Same dimensions as a credit card<br /> <EOL>* Unique gift for any occasion",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56017,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Crap Supplies/Craps Accessories,,3.880,,Wednesday 11 June 2014 08:42:30 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.850,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312292,CSP-30-5001,mohammad,Casino Supply Craps Top Rail Rubber Casino Grade: Sold per Foot,Casino Supply Craps Top Rail Rubber Casino Grade: Sold per Foot,0.580,5.850,0,,* Craps Top Rail Rubber Casino Grade (Sold per Foot) goes above the pyramid rubber and is used as a lining along the inside top end of the craps table.<br /> <EOL>* Our casino grade green top rail rubber is 3-3/8 inches tall measuring from the flat back side.<br /> <EOL>* A full size 12 foot craps table needs approximately 19 feet of top rail rubber.<br /> <EOL>* Sold in contiguous lengths up to 50 feet long.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56017,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Crap Supplies/Craps Accessories,,5.580,,Wednesday 11 June 2014 08:54:22 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,4.100,63,N,222,Casino Supply
311984,CSP-15-0005,mohammad,"Casino Supply Craps, Blackjack, Roulette, Baccarat: 4 in 1 Game Set","Casino Supply Craps, Blackjack, Roulette, Baccarat: 4 in 1 Game Set",12.700,59.950,0,,"* Here is our combination Craps, Blackjack, Roulette, Baccarat 4 in 1 Game Set.<br /> <EOL>* This is a 4 in 1 table measuring 36 x 18.<br /> <EOL>* It has a built in craps on one side and roulette on the other side with a separate layout for blackjack and baccarat.<br /> <EOL>* The set includes chips, cards, dice, roulette wheel, roulette rake, and roulette pills.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56007,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Blackjack Supplies/Blackjack Tables,,62.110,,Friday 06 June 2014 06:30:18 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,47.960,63,N,222,Casino Supply
