314235,CSP-64-0014RP,ariel2,Casino Supply CSC Elegant Mah Jong Set & Luggage-Style Wheeled Case & Modern Pushers Racks,Casino Supply CSC Elegant Mah Jong Set & Luggage-Style Wheeled Case,12,158.850,0,,"<b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* High quality luxurious slim line luggage-style wheeled black aluminum case for the discerning player that features reinforced ergonomic retractable handle, fully padded interior, extra strong latches and hinges, as well as beautifully accented corner protectors.<br /> <EOL>* 4 clear colorful lucite plastic modern racks with built-in pushers.<br /> <EOL>* 166 Large precisely sized brilliantly colored engraved tiles feature crisp and clear characters in full color for your total enjoyment.<br /> <EOL>* Enclosed in elegant velour drawstring bags (not loose in the case) are a set of betting coins, 3 dice and a wind indicator button for seating placement.<br /> <EOL>* 30 Days Unconditional Money Back Guarantee!<br /> <EOL>* Fast Shipping - in stock and ready to go!!!!<br /><br /> <EOL>* Take your game to the next level with our elegant Mah Jong sets.<br /> <EOL>* This full size American/Western Style Mah Jong Set comes in a very stylish looking luggage-style wheeled black aluminum case measuring 22 1/2"" x 9 1/2"" x 5"" inches that features reinforced ergonomic handles, extra strong latches and hinges, as well as beautifully accented corner protectors, fully padded interior and rubber protective feet.<br /> <EOL>* The retractable easy grip handle when extended reaches to a height of 33 inches making this case very easy to roll.<br /> <EOL>* Total weight of set with case is 12 1/2 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* This set has 166 tiles, including all the 144 tiles for classical Chinese play as well as an extra 22 tiles for the American version of the game.<br /> <EOL>* 4 clear colorful lucite plastic modern racks with built-in pushers.<br /> <EOL>* With this set you can comfortably play either version.<br /> <EOL>* To play the Chinese version simply use the red dragons as the 'hong zhong' and the green dragons as the 'fa' tiles.<br /> <EOL>* The large tiles are precisely sized and brilliantly painted with engraved Chinese characters and numbers made out of heavy, scratch resistant melamine.<br /> <EOL>* They are protected in two heavy duty trays with covers.<br /> <EOL>* The tiles measure 1 3/16"" H x 7/8"" W x 1/2"" thick (30mm x 22mm x 13mm). <br /> <EOL>* The 166 tiles include: 36 Circles, 36 Characters, 36 Bamboos, 16 Winds (N, E, S, W), 16 flowers, 12 Dragons, 10 Jokers, and 4 Blank Spare Tiles.<br /> <EOL>* Also included is an English illustrated instruction manual that will help everybody to learn how to play.<br /> <EOL>* If you want to become the envy of your Mah Jong group, go ahead and treat yourself to our elegant American Mah Jong set.<br /> <EOL>* Compliments are guaranteed!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56059,Casino Supply/More/New Items,,157.860,,Tuesday 24 June 2014 11:49:00 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,127.080,63,N,222,Casino Supply
