315154,CSP-60-7001,mohammad,"Casino Supply Custom Pool Table Felt with Matching Rails: Fabric - Economy (Temporary Use), Table Size: 7' / 8'",Casino Supply Custom Pool Table Felt with Matching Rails: Fabric,11,279,0,,"* A custom pool table felt is ultimate way to add new life to your table.<br /> <EOL>* We have been custom printing professional casino game table felts for many years and now offer the same services for your custom printed pool table felt.<br /> <EOL>* Our brilliant, long-lasting graphics are dyed directly into the playing surface - not screened on top of the surface.<br /> <EOL>* You can not feel any of the printing.<br /> <EOL>* We know you only want the best for you table so we use only the highest quality materials.<br /> <EOL>* Our heavy weight Premium Material custom pool table felt offers amazing print quality and has unlimited design possibilities.<br /> <EOL>* Our custom pool table felt features an anti-friction coating to ensure reliable and accurate English.<br /> <EOL>* Your custom pool table felt also features a 40 gram laminated backing to manage ball travel.<br /> <EOL>* A high quality stain resistant coating will protect your custom pool table felt from most stains.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Amazing Print Quality<br /> <EOL>* Unlimited Design Options<br /> <EOL>* Anti-Friction Coating<br /> <EOL>* Heavyweight 40 Gram Backing<br /> <EOL>* High Quality Stain Resistant Coating<br /> <EOL>* Includes Matching Rails<br /> <EOL>* FREE Ground Shipping<br /> <EOL>* If you are on a budget or only need to use the custom pool felt temporarily, we have an Economy Material option.<br /> <EOL>* This is the same high quality material we use on all of our casino game layouts, so don't let the ""Economy"" name fool you.<br /> <EOL>* It is a stain resistant, spill resisitant, flame retardant material that has amazing print quality.<br /> <EOL>* Bright colors and dynamic graphics from edge to edge.<br /> <EOL>* The Economy material does not have the anti-friction coating or the heavyweight backing, but otherwise it is an exellent option.<br /> <EOL>* After placing your order, one of our graphic artists will contact you to discuss the order and get a little more information from you regarding the design.<br /> <EOL>* Then, we will create a full color proof to email you showing how your new custom pool table felt will look on your table.<br /> <EOL>* Once you approve the design, we will print and ship your order within a few days.<br /> <EOL>* Your order will be shipped rolled up to prevent any wrinkles in the fabric.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56068,Casino Supply/More/Pool Table Felts,,292.080,,Sunday 29 June 2014 11:45:20 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,237.150,63,N,222,Casino Supply
