315114,CSP-31-2104,mohammad,"Casino Supply Dice Tops and Bottoms: Transparent Red, Passers, 1,5,6 & 3,4,5","Casino Supply Dice Tops and Bottoms: Transparent Red, Passers, 1,5,6",0.040,18.950,0,,"* Dice Tops and Bottoms (Passers) 1, 5, 6 & 3, 4, 5 are dice that have only three numbers represented on each die (each number will be represented on two faces of the die). <br /> <EOL>* Commonly called Suicide T's, or No craps No 7's, or 4 to 11's.<br /> <EOL>* This set consists of (2) regular 5/8 inch (16mm) acrylic dice, and (1) tops with numbers 1, 5, & 6 and (1) bottom with numbers 3, 4, & 5.<br /> <EOL>* The only numbers these ""Passers"" can roll are 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10 & 11 which is quite an advantage when the shooter is rolling the dice after a point has been established.<br /> <EOL>* You cannot crap out with these dice, as craps is 2, 3, 7 or 12 on the first roll and 7 thereafter.<br /> <EOL>* These dice favor the numbers 9 and 10.<br /> <EOL>* For Amusement Only",,0,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56058,Casino Supply/More,,24.750,,Sunday 29 June 2014 09:06:36 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,18.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
