312861,CSP-51-2007,mohammad,"Casino Supply Knockout Poker Table Rail Vinyl: Black, Two-Way Stretch, Per Running Foot","Casino Supply Knockout Poker Table Rail Vinyl: Black, Two-Way Stretch",0.900,3.850,0,,"* This Knockout Poker Table Rail Black Vinyl - Two-Way Stretch (sold per running foot) is our most economical 2-way stretch vinyl.<br /> <EOL>* It is about 25% lighter than most of our other vinyls but is considerably less expensive.<br /> <EOL>* The poker table rail is one of the most important components of a quality poker table.<br /> <EOL>* A well built poker table rail will provide a high level of comfort that will last throughout years of play.<br /> <EOL>* Our heavy-duty armrest vinyl's are tear proof, waterproof and ultra thick, yet soft for easy stretching and stapling.<br /> <EOL>* You will love the feel and look of your poker table after using this vinyl.<br /> <EOL>* Keep in mind, if you want a seamless rail (rail without stitching or gaps, you will have to buy a long enough section to cover the entire table.(i.e. an 8 foot table would need 9 ft of vinyl) SOLD BY THE RUNNING FOOT<br /> <EOL><br /><b> PROPERTIES: </b><br /> <EOL>* Ultra high quality<br /> <EOL>* Custom cut to your required length<br /> <EOL>* Sold by the running foot - I.E. Amount of 2 = 24"" x 54""<br /> <EOL>* Width: 54 inches wide<br /> <EOL>* Weight: 26 oz. per linear yard (36 inches x 54 inches)<br /> <EOL>* Abrasion resistance: Passes 30, 000 Double Rubs<br /> <EOL>* Flammability: Passes FMVSS302, Cal.Bulletin 117 Sec.E<br /> <EOL>* Textured look<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof<br /> <EOL>* Super thick, tear-proof<br /> <EOL>* Will withstand years of constant wear and tear",,999991,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56030,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Poker Table Rail Vinyl,,4.300,,Sunday 15 June 2014 10:49:37 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.080,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312562,CSP-33-0001,ariel2,Casino Supply Ladies Poker Card Guard Spinner,Casino Supply Ladies Poker Card Guard Spinner,0.080,6.850,0,,"* This is our premium quality gold plated, solid brass Ladies Poker Card Guard Spinner.<br /> <EOL>* Ladies spinner is a beautifully detailed with one of the strongest starting hands in Texas HoldEm a Pair of Aces.<br /> <EOL>* We have reproduced this hand in a shiny gold brass coin.<br /> <EOL>* This 1.625 inch diameter card guard spinner is enclosed in a 2 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker.<br /> <EOL>* The detailed graphics are embedded in the spinner then covered with a clear laminate to prevent fading or wear during the life of this product and protect it against any spills or moisture.<br /> <EOL>* The eye-catching colorful artwork is HAND PAINTED on each piece, giving it a one-of-a-kind quality.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the card guard over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* When your opponents take too long to decide what to bet you can pass the time by spinning this card guard spinner.<br /> <EOL>* There is a small raised dot on the bottom of this spinner which allows you to spin it like a top.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!<br /> <EOL>* The perfect gift for any poker fan!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,6.990,,Friday 13 June 2014 09:42:36 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,5.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312563,CSP-50-0103,mohammad,Casino Supply Lady Luck Poker Card Guard Protector,Casino Supply Lady Luck Poker Card Guard Protector,0.160,6.850,0,,"* Beautiful metal two sided full color Lady Luck Poker Card (Guard) Protector.<br /> <EOL>* This is a heavy (weighs almost 3 oz.) 2 inch diameter card protector enclosed in a 2 3/4 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker.<br /> <EOL>* A card protector is an item that is placed on top of cards at a card game and protects them from accidentally being ""mucked"".<br /> <EOL>* What does ""muck"" mean?<br /> <EOL>* In poker, mucked cards are those folded and thrown back to the dealer, or into a pile of cards that have been folded by other players.<br /> <EOL>* If your hand is accidentally mucked, your hand is dead.<br /> <EOL>* You can't retrieve it from the pile of mucked cards.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>How does one use it?</b><br /> <EOL>* If you look at your cards immediately after them being dealt, place your protector on top of your cards whether you're going to play the hand or not.<br /> <EOL>* If you only place your protector on your cards when you have good enough cards to play, you'll be ""telling"" your opponents that you have good cards when your protector is on your cards and you have bad cards when you don't put the protector on your cards.<br /> <EOL>* If you are a player that waits until your turn to look at your cards, after you've been dealt your cards, you should place the protector on top of the cards, this will keep the dealer from thinking you have folded and/or mucked your cards.<br /> <EOL>* After you look at your cards, and decide to play, put your protector back on top of your cards.<br /> <EOL>* If you do no play, simply muck your cards and wait till the next hand.<br /> <EOL>* When not actively looking at their hand cards, players must place them face down on the table in front of their chips.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the coin over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* Hold'Em, Omaha, Stud and other poker players can use this product to secure their cards during play.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,6.990,,Friday 13 June 2014 09:51:45 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,5.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312098,CSP-65-0009,mohammad,Casino Supply Large Party Bingo Set: Rubberized,Casino Supply Large Party Bingo Set: Rubberized,6,48.850,0,,"* This ultimate Large Party Bingo Set for adults and children includes a large, top quality bingo cage, a solid constructed hard plastic bingo master board, bingo hard cards, and bingo balls.<br /> <EOL>* The high quality metal cage is black rubber coated for extra durability.<br /> <EOL>* Great bingo game fun for the entire family and friends!<br /> <EOL>* Commonly used at home parties for entertainment.<br /> <EOL>* Not intended for gambling purposes.<br /> <EOL>* Unsuitable for children under age three as there are small parts.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Party bingo set including:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Multi-Colored 3/4 inch plastic balls numbered 1 - 75<br /> <EOL>* 18 Reusable Bingo Cards<br /> <EOL>* Hard Plastic Master Board (17.5""h x 6.75""d)<br /> <EOL>* Rubberized Black Cage (12.5""h x 8.5""d)",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56003,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Bingo Supplies/Bingo Game Sets & Equipment,,47.450,,Saturday 07 June 2014 11:45:15 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,36.640,63,N,222,Casino Supply
