313719,CSP-90-7702,mohammad,"Casino Supply Nevada Jacks 10g Ceramic Poker Chips: Denomination - $1, 25 per Package",Casino Supply Nevada Jacks 10g Ceramic Poker Chips: Denomination - $1,0.780,13.850,0,,"* Get ready for a great poker game!<br /> <EOL>* These world renowned Nevada Jack Poker Chips are the closest thing to a casino chip that you are going to get outside of Vegas.<br /> <EOL>* Many casinos around the world use ceramic chips.<br /> <EOL>* Ceramic chips are of a much higher quality than composite or even most clay composites.<br /> <EOL>* These ceramic chips are a full 10 gram casino weight with a textured surface and the graphics printed directly on the chip as opposed to an inlay or sticker used on Clay Chips.<br /> <EOL>* In addition to its casino feel, an advantage this chip has over its clay counterpart is its ability to accept higher quality graphics using the entire face of the chip.<br /> <EOL>* On the edge of the chips, there is also a marble-like finish with vertical stripes at six points around the chip's perimeter.<br /> <EOL>* Few chips can come close to replicating this classy appearance.<br /> <EOL>* All chips feature a colorful illustration of the Nevada Jack logo and a deceased old west gambler.<br /> <EOL>* Appropriately enough, he is holding ""the dead man's hand, "" aces and eights, the hand reputedly held by ""Wild"" Bill Hickok at his untimely death.<br /> <EOL>* Available in 8 colors and denominations between 25¢ and $5000.<br /> <EOL>* The detail on these chips is flawless and their unique design makes them great for casinos and homestyle play.<br /> <EOL>* These chips come in plastic wrapped rolls of 25.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Casino Quality Ceramic Chips<br /> <EOL>* Casino Weight 10 Gram Chips<br /> <EOL>* Extremely Popular Nevada Jack Design<br /> <EOL>* Available in 8 Denominations<br /> <EOL>* Textured Inlay Allows for Easy Stacking",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56034,Casino Supply/Poker Chips,,11.210,,Saturday 21 June 2014 04:59:23 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,8.310,63,N,222,Casino Supply
