312447,CSP-15-4001NYNY,shahmuhammad,Casino Supply NYNY Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,Casino Supply NYNY Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,0.220,1.350,0,,"* These Cancelled Casino Playing Cards are a great value and are the same cards used in major casinos.<br /> <EOL>* Casino cards are usually changed every 8 hours or less - regardless of use.<br /> <EOL>* After they are removed from the casino tables, they are sorted, counted, and ""cancelled"" discretely by a cutting two opposite corners (to prevent cheating). <br /> <EOL>* We never sell cards with a hole drilled in the center of the deck.<br /> <EOL>* Our canceled casino cards are always in excellent condition.<br /> <EOL>* We do not recommend using these cards in live cash games as there is always a possibility of a card being damaged, missing, or marked in some manner.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 2.5 x 3.5 inches",,999993,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,3.500,3.500,2.500,1000,Y,56047,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Used Casino Playing Cards,,1.300,,Friday 13 June 2014 03:59:25 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313793,CSP-96-0202,mohammad,Casino Supply Oak 200 Chip Poker Case 1,Casino Supply Oak 200 Chip Poker Case 1,3.990,24.850,0,,"* This is our quality Oak 200 Chip Poker Case sure to please any poker enthusiast.<br /> <EOL>* This wood stained chip case shows the character of the wood grain both in the case and in the two 100 capacity chip trays.<br /> <EOL>* Below the chip trays is a fairly large area for storing several decks of cars and various buttons or lammers.<br /> <EOL>* Each chip tray is removable from the chip case and holds 100 chips.<br /> <EOL>* This makes the case even more versatile, since you can transport the individual chip trays wherever you may need them.<br /> <EOL>* Players can even use them for organization at the table.<br /> <EOL>* The outside of the case is further accentuated with brass latches to ensure that the case doesn't accidentally open.<br /> <EOL>* The solid oak handle is securely fastened for years of use.<br /> <EOL>* Don't be fooled by lower quality cases.<br /> <EOL>* We have taken great care to ensure this case has the upgraded strength where required.",,999999,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56038,Casino Supply/Poker Chips/Poker Chip Cases,,25.960,,Saturday 21 June 2014 11:51:24 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,19.880,63,N,222,Casino Supply
