314354,CSP-55-3277,mohammad,"Casino Supply Party Assorted Cutouts: 18 Inch, Package of 4","Casino Supply Party Assorted Cutouts: 18 Inch, Package of 4",0.320,3.250,0,,"* Place your bets please!<br /> <EOL>* This pack of double sided 4 Vegas Casino Party Assorted Cutouts is perfect for that poker or casino night Vegas style party.<br /> <EOL>* Each of the four Vegas cutouts is roughly 18 inches high, so they make a really great set of decorations.<br /> <EOL>* The pack includes a roulette wheel, cards, dice and a slot machine.<br /> <EOL>* These cutouts are made of sturdy card stock and printed on both sides.<br /> <EOL>* Attaches with your own double-sided tape or use our no residue party stick tape 55-3325 to attach all of your casino wall decorations.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56060,Casino Supply/More/Casino Party Decorations,,3.540,,Thursday 26 June 2014 12:11:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.600,63,N,222,Casino Supply
314355,CSP-55-0075,mohammad,Casino Supply Party Giant Cutout and Banner,Casino Supply Party Giant Cutout and Banner,0.650,4.500,0,,* Make an announcement with this vibrant Casino Party Giant Cutout and Banner that the casino night is at your place by giving your guests the feel of a real Vegas casino when they enter your casino night party.<br /> <EOL>* This Vegas Casino Cutout and Banner incorporates the bright neon look with the familiar cards and dice symbols all your party guests will recognize.<br /> <EOL>* Nobody will miss you house with these giant banner decorations.<br /> <EOL>* Use this Vegas Casino Cutout and Banner to decorate the entrance to your party or hang it over the area where all the action happens!<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Use indoors or outdoors.<br /> <EOL>* Each package includes: <br /> <EOL>* Casino Cutout measuring 19.5 inches by 39 inches<br /> <EOL>* Casino Banner measuring 7 inches by 39 inches<br /> <EOL>* Material: Plastic coated card stock,,999999,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56060,Casino Supply/More/Casino Party Decorations,,4.900,,Thursday 26 June 2014 12:20:20 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.600,63,N,222,Casino Supply
314572,CSP-55-5011,mohammad,"Casino Supply Party Hot/Cold Cups: 9 oz., Package of 8","Casino Supply Party Hot/Cold Cups: 9 oz., Package of 8",0.140,2.890,0,,"* Our Casino Party Hot/Cold Cups are the perfect choice for any hot or cold casino refreshments!<br /> <EOL>* These quality Casino Party Cups will complement your casino night or card party event and make cleanup a winning proposition.<br /> <EOL>* Casino Party Cups feature a big neon dollar sign and 'Casino' marquee on a starry black background.<br /> <EOL>* These cups are the perfect addition for your party.<br /> <EOL>* This is an easy way to add style to your casino night event.<br /> <EOL>* This package contains 8 cups made in the USA, holding 9 oz.<br /> <EOL>* Look for our coordinating tableware, decorations, invitations, and more (sold separately).",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56060,Casino Supply/More/Casino Party Decorations,,3.150,,Friday 27 June 2014 04:03:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.310,63,N,222,Casino Supply
314386,CSP-55-3325,mohammad,Casino Supply Party Stick Mounting Tabs: Package of 32,Casino Supply Party Stick Mounting Tabs: Package of 32,0.030,3.190,0,,"* Our Party Stick Mounting Tabs remove easily and cleanly without any restrictions.<br /> <EOL>* These adhesive tabs hold tightly where ordinary tape won't so your decorations will stay secure until you are ready to remove them.<br /> <EOL>* Tabs remove cleanly without leaving unwanted residue.<br /> <EOL>* Use them on glass, cement, drywall and even finished wood.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Foam adhesive tabs<br /> <EOL>* Sticks to most surfaces: glass, cement block, drywall, and finished wood<br /> <EOL>* Holds approximately 1 ounce of weight when applied to a smooth, clean surface<br /> <EOL>* On most surface, removes easily and cleanly without leaving residue<br /> <EOL>* Measures 1/2 inch by 1 inch<br /> <EOL>* Contains thirty-two (32) mounting tabs",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56060,Casino Supply/More/Casino Party Decorations,,3.910,,Thursday 26 June 2014 09:43:42 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.870,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312451,CSP-15-4001Peppermill,shahmuhammad,Casino Supply Peppermill Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,Casino Supply Peppermill Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,0.220,1.350,0,,"* These Cancelled Casino Playing Cards are a great value and are the same cards used in major casinos.<br /> <EOL>* Casino cards are usually changed every 8 hours or less - regardless of use.<br /> <EOL>* After they are removed from the casino tables, they are sorted, counted, and ""cancelled"" discretely by a cutting two opposite corners (to prevent cheating). <br /> <EOL>* We never sell cards with a hole drilled in the center of the deck.<br /> <EOL>* Our canceled casino cards are always in excellent condition.<br /> <EOL>* We do not recommend using these cards in live cash games as there is always a possibility of a card being damaged, missing, or marked in some manner.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 2.5 x 3.5 inches",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56047,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Used Casino Playing Cards,,1.300,,Friday 13 June 2014 04:27:55 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313093,CSP-50-0033,mohammad,Casino Supply Perfect Padded Rail (Per Ft ): No Returns Cut Material,Casino Supply Perfect Padded Rail (Per Ft ): No Returns Cut Material,0.750,3.950,0,,"* Manufactured for us is the quickest and simplest way to have a Perfect Padded Rail on your tables.<br /> <EOL>* This material is a very hard dense rubber which has a slit in the center.<br /> <EOL>* You simply push it on the edge of the table (table thicknesses from 3/4 inch to 1 inch work the best) and staple the bottom of the padded rail to the table.<br /> <EOL>* The top of the padded rail will sit on the upper portion of your table and is not stapled to allow for slide under drink cups.<br /> <EOL>* The padded rail diameter is 2.5 inches and the wall thickness is 5/8 inch.<br /> <EOL>* This will allow a comfortable overlap of about 1.5 inches over the edge of your table (on a typical 3/4 or 1 inch table). <br /> <EOL>* If you are going completely around the table we have matching seam tape item 50-0040 which overlaps the seam for a finished look.<br /> <EOL>* We cut the railing in 40 foot sections unless otherwise notified.<br /> <EOL>* If you need a length of Padded Rail greater than 40', we will need to cut the rail or ship by truck.<br /> <EOL>* Please let us know in the comments section how you would like it cut.",,999979,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,4.570,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 05:56:43 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.360,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312453,CSP-15-4001Pioneer Club,shahmuhammad,Casino Supply Pioneer Club Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,Casino Supply Pioneer Club Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,0.220,1.350,0,,"* These Cancelled Casino Playing Cards are a great value and are the same cards used in major casinos.<br /> <EOL>* Casino cards are usually changed every 8 hours or less - regardless of use.<br /> <EOL>* After they are removed from the casino tables, they are sorted, counted, and ""cancelled"" discretely by a cutting two opposite corners (to prevent cheating). <br /> <EOL>* We never sell cards with a hole drilled in the center of the deck.<br /> <EOL>* Our canceled casino cards are always in excellent condition.<br /> <EOL>* We do not recommend using these cards in live cash games as there is always a possibility of a card being damaged, missing, or marked in some manner.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 2.5 x 3.5 inches",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56047,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Used Casino Playing Cards,,1.300,,Friday 13 June 2014 04:31:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
