313873,CSP-15-4707,ariel2,"Casino Supply Plastic Flexible Cut Cards: Black, Bridge - Narrow, Pack of 10","Casino Supply Plastic flexible Cut Cards: Black, Bridge - Narrow",0.010,2.250,0,,"* Plastic cut cards are used in blackjack to divide the playing cards in a dealing shoe and to remind the dealer when it's time to reshuffle.<br /> <EOL>* In poker, the cut card prevents exposing the bottom card of a deck of playing cards.<br /> <EOL>* This is why it is advisable to use a cut card placed under the bottom of the deck preventing the bottom card from being seen.<br /><br/> <EOL><b>Product Features: </b><br /> <EOL>* Bridge (narrow size) 2.25 inches x 3.50 inches<br /> <EOL>* Poker (wide size) 2.50 inches x 3.50 inches<br /> <EOL>* Assorted solid colors",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56055,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Cut Cards,,2.160,,Sunday 22 June 2014 07:58:44 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,1.580,63,N,222,Casino Supply
