312008,CSP-30-3200,mohammad,"Casino Supply Poker Chips with Rack: Simulated Pearl, 200 Pcs.","Casino Supply Poker Chips with Rack: Simulated Pearl, 200 Pcs.",1.350,19.850,0,,"* These 200 Simulated Pearl Poker Chips with Rack will add a European touch to your game.<br /> <EOL>* Can be used as lammers or game chips.<br /> <EOL>* Assorted sizes, colors and denominations of chips printed on both sides with values as follows: denomination of 5 (60 pieces), 10 (60 pieces), 50 (40 pieces), 100 (20 pieces), and 500 (20 pieces). <br /> <EOL>* This set also includes 2 plastic storage racks with lids.<br /> <EOL>* Each rack measures 8.25 L x 3.0 W x 1.25 H",,999999,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56021,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Roulette Supplies/Roulette Accessories,,18.590,,Saturday 07 June 2014 12:46:47 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,13.900,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312473,CSP-30-1110,ariel2,"Casino Supply Poker Dice: 5/8 Inch, Package of 5","Casino Supply Poker Dice: 5/8 Inch, Package of 5",0.060,1.950,0,,"* These Poker Dice 5/8 Inch (Pkg./5) are dice which, instead of having number pips, have representations of playing cards upon them.<br /> <EOL>* Poker dice have six sides, one each of an Ace, King, Queen, Jack, ten and nine, and are used to form a poker hand.<br /> <EOL>* The classic poker dice game is played with 5 dice.<br /> <EOL>* Each player has a total of 3 rolls and the ability to hold dice in between rolls.<br /> <EOL>* After the three rolls the best hand wins.<br /> <EOL>* Neither a ""flush"" nor a ""straight flush"" is a possible hand, due to the lack of suits on the dice.<br /> <EOL>* Each variety of poker dice varies slightly in regards to suits, though the ace of spades is almost universally represented.<br /> <EOL>* 9 (Club) and 10 (Diamond) are frequently found, while face cards are traditionally represented not by suit but instead by color: green, red and blue.<br /> <EOL>* Manufacturers have not standardized the colors of the face sides.<br /> <EOL>* Sold in a set of 5 dice.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55954,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Accessories,,1.870,,Friday 13 June 2014 05:30:18 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,1.370,63,N,222,Casino Supply
