313094,CSP-50-0032,mohammad,Casino Supply Poker Table Foam Padding: 42 x 72 x 3/8 Inch,Casino Supply Poker Table Foam Padding: 42 x 72 x 3/8 Inch,6,14.850,0,,"* This is our 3/8 x 42 x 72 inch open cell gray Poker Table Foam Padding which is perfect for cushioning under the poker table felt of the playing surface.<br /> <EOL>* You then cover the foam with your material of choice (vinyl, cloth, leather, etc...) to create the desired effect.<br /> <EOL>* Using a foam padding under the poker table felt and vinyl adds a luxurious feel to your poker table.<br /> <EOL>* This 42 wide open cell table foam is sold by the sheet.<br /> <EOL>* Shipping rate is accurate for ground shipping only.<br /> <EOL>* Please call for air rates if needed.<br /> <EOL>* Our table foam is available in two types of foam; Open Cell and Closed Cell.<br /> <EOL>* Open cell foam is your standard foam with a porous design (sponge-like).<br /> <EOL>* Closed cell foam is a firmer non-porous, waterproof design.<br /> <EOL>* Volara item 50-0038 is this type of foam.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Poker table top foam<br /> <EOL>* Measurements: 42"" x 72"" x 3/8"" (width x length x thickness)<br /> <EOL>* For customized poker table padding<br /> <EOL>* Great for oval and rounded poker tables<br /> <EOL>* Apply adhesive see item 50-0055 to both foam and table to ensure proper adhesion",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,15.020,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 06:04:46 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,11.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313096,CSP-50-0571,mohammad,Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Kit: Black,Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Kit: Black,12.210,79.150,0,,"* This Poker Table Rail Foam Kit includes 3 strips of 1"" x 9"" x 105"" quality 70 lb.- 1.3 density charcoal polyurethane (our item #50-0054 and one sheet of (choice of colors) vinyl measuring 54"" x 108"" (our item #51-20 at a low discount price and perfect for custom 4' x 8' poker table railings.<br /> <EOL>* We are also including one large 12 ounce can of Camie Spray foam adhesive, (our item #50-0055).",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,81.330,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 06:09:17 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,63.320,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313104,CSP-50-0053,ariel2,"Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Sheet: 70 Pound, 1"" x 54"" x 105""","Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Sheet: 70 Pound, 1"" x 54"" x 1###",9,55.850,0,,"* This Poker Table Rail Foam Sheet 1 x 54 x 105 Inches 70 lb.- 1.3 density charcoal polyurethane is perfect for custom poker table padded rails.<br /> <EOL>* To install on railing, apply foam over wood surface and use adhesive spray 50-0055 between the wood surface and foam.<br /> <EOL>* Apply adhesive to both foam and table to ensure proper adhesion.<br /> <EOL>* Apply vinyl over the foam to complete the railing.<br /> <EOL>* Be careful of ""pre-cut"" foam padded rails.<br /> <EOL>* Some companies offer ""pre-cut"" rails, but what they don't tell you is that it comes in multiple pieces....leaving you with the headache and extra time to try and cover your seams so that they do not show through your vinyl padded rail.<br /> <EOL>* This poker table rail foam is in FULL sheets.<br /> <EOL>* No worries about how to piece your rail foam together.<br /> <EOL>* PLEASE NOTE: Due to the large size of foam once it is rolled up to be shipped, we HAVE to vacuum suck all foam rubber sheets down.<br /> <EOL>* The Foam will NOT be it's original size once you open your package....PLEASE allow 2-3 days for the foam to ""recover"" to it's full width.<br /> <EOL>* 1 inch foam packages need to be opened immediately once you receive the package.<br /> <EOL>* Do not let the foam sit unopened for more than 1 week!<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Poker table top padded rail foam<br /> <EOL>* 1 inch 70 lb.<br /> <EOL>* 1.3 density foam<br /> <EOL>* Size: 54 x 105 x 1 inches (l x w x h)<br /> <EOL>* For custom built poker table railing<br /> <EOL>* Apply adhesive to foam and table",,999999,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,71.730,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 06:44:40 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,55.850,63,N,222,Casino Supply
313105,CSP-50-0054,mohammad,"Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Strip: 70 Pound, 1"" x 9"" x 105""","Casino Supply Poker Table Rail Foam Strip: 70 Pound, 1"" x 9"" x 105""",3.030,14.850,0,,"* Poker table rail foam 1 inch x 9 inch wide x 105 inches long 70 lb.- 1.3 density charcoal grey polyurethane foam, perfect for custom poker table padded rails.<br /> <EOL>* To install on railing, apply foam over wood surface and use adhesive spray 50-0055 between the wood surface and foam.<br /> <EOL>* Apply adhesive to both foam and table to ensure proper adhesion.<br /> <EOL>* Apply vinyl over the foam to complete the railing.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Poker table top padded rail foam<br /> <EOL>* 1 inch 70 lb.1.3 density foam<br /> <EOL>* For custom built poker table railing<br /> <EOL>* Apply adhesive to foam and table",,999997,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,20.220,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 06:50:51 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,14.850,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312335,CSP-50-0075,mohammad,"Casino Supply Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth: Burgundy, Sold per Running Foot",Casino Supply Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth: Burgundy,0.500,3.850,0,,"* Beautiful diamond Poker Table Waterproof Suited Speed Cloth at a low discount price for your game room table.<br /> <EOL>* Build your table with the best cloth available.<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth is the number one choice for poker table felt used today!<br /> <EOL>* This is the best poker cloth if you want durability and playability!<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth will last the life of your table.<br /> <EOL>* There will be no need to replace your poker table felt every couple of months like some other poker cloths; our fabric is treated with a super waterproofing agent.<br /> <EOL>* Liquids just bead up on the fabric, they do not soak in.<br /> <EOL>* Any spills are easily cleaned up.<br /> <EOL>* Our cloth has an extremely soft feel and fights tough stains to provide lasting beauty and longevity.- sold by the running foot 60 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* For example if you purchase 3 units, you'll receive a piece of cloth 36 inches long by 59 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* An entire roll is 50 yards long.<br /> <EOL>* We offer the suited speed cloth in several colors.<br /> <EOL>* For those of you who want the ultimate custom poker cloth, we offer Dye Sublimated poker table felt customized to your exact specifications.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Pattern:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Features a repeating Heart, Diamond, Spade, and Club pattern to them.<br /> <EOL>* Each Heart, Diamond, Spade and Club is inside a repeating diamond shaped outline that is 1 1/4"" Inch x 1 1/4"" Inch Square.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* 59 inches wide (sold by the running foot)<br /> <EOL>* High definition with bright colors<br /> <EOL>* Suited pattern<br /> <EOL>* 100% Polyester<br /> <EOL>* Water Resistant - There is no need to treat this cloth with any other fabric protectors!<br /> <EOL>* Extremely durable<br /> <EOL>* Retains its natural softness<br /> <EOL>* PLEASE NOTE: This product is cut to order and cannot be returned for a refund",,999988,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55996,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Table Cloth,,3.930,,Thursday 12 June 2014 05:39:43 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.890,63,N,222,Casino Supply
