312836,CSP-50-0076,mohammad,Casino Supply Standard Universal Metal Drop Box with 2 Locks: No Sleeve,Casino Supply Standard Universal Metal Drop Box with 2 Locks,12,86.750,0,,"* Standard Size Universal Professional Casino Drop Box with two cam locks and four keys.<br /> <EOL>* This item has two different sets of keys.<br /> <EOL>* The first set of keys unlocks the drop box from the outer shield.<br /> <EOL>* The outer shield is the steel cover that is attached to the underside of the game table and holds the drop box securely.<br /> <EOL>* The drop box locks directly into the shield.<br /> <EOL>* During the release, the drop box hole closes to ensure against tampering.<br /> <EOL>* Many casinos use a different drop box for each shift.<br /> <EOL>* Chips fall through the money drop slot or poker drop slide into the hole in the shield, and finally into the drop box.<br /> <EOL>* The second set of keys opens the side door of the drop box and the contents can be removed.<br /> <EOL>* This item also features a sturdy handle to ensure that the heavy weight is easily and safely transported away from the table to the casino cashier cage.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Our standard casino quality Standard size drop box<br /> <EOL>* Dual professional cam locks with four keys<br /> <EOL>* Quality inner drop box spring mechanism<br /> <EOL>* Universal style (accepts both chips and paper money)<br /> <EOL>* Measures 12.25 x 8.25 x 8.5 inches high",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56028,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Casino Table Drop Boxes,,83.560,,Sunday 15 June 2014 08:39:17 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,65.060,63,N,222,Casino Supply
