312345,CSP-50-0090WHITE,ariel2,Casino Supply Standard White Suited Speed Cloth: Sold per Running Foot,Casino Supply Standard White Suited Speed Cloth: Sold per Running Foot,0.500,2.850,0,,"* Beautiful diamond Casino Poker Table White Suited Speed Cloth (Sold per Running Foot) at a low discount price for your game room table.<br /> <EOL>* Build your table with the best cloth available.<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth is the number one choice for poker table felt used today!<br /> <EOL>* This is the best poker cloth if you want durability and playability!<br /> <EOL>* Suited Speed Cloth will last the life of your table.<br /> <EOL>* There will be no need to replace your poker table felt every couple of months like some other poker cloths.<br /> <EOL>* Sold by the running foot 60 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* For example if you purchase 3 units, you'll receive a piece of cloth 36 inches long by 59 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* An entire roll is 50 yards long.<br /> <EOL>* We offer the suited speed cloth in several colors.<br /> <EOL>* For those of you who want the ultimate custom poker cloth, we offer Dye Sublimated poker table felt customized to your exact specifications.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Pattern:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Features a repeating Heart, Diamond, Spade, and Club pattern to them.<br /> <EOL>* Each Heart, Diamond, Spade and Club is inside a repeating diamond shaped outline that is 1 1/4"" Inch x 1 1/4"" Inch Square.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Product Features:</b> <br /> <EOL>* 59 inches wide (sold by the running foot)<br /> <EOL>* Suited pattern<br /> <EOL>* 70% Polyester 30% Dacron<br /> <EOL>* Extremely durable<br /> <EOL>* PLEASE NOTE: This product is cut to order and cannot be returned for a refund<br /> <EOL>* This speed cloth is not waterproof.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55996,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Table Cloth,,2.920,,Thursday 12 June 2014 09:12:47 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,2.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
