312464,CSP-15-4001Stratosphere,shahmuhammad,Casino Supply Stratosphere Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,Casino Supply Stratosphere Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,0.220,1.350,0,,"* These Cancelled Casino Playing Cards are a great value and are the same cards used in major casinos.<br /> <EOL>* Casino cards are usually changed every 8 hours or less - regardless of use.<br /> <EOL>* After they are removed from the casino tables, they are sorted, counted, and ""cancelled"" discretely by a cutting two opposite corners (to prevent cheating). <br /> <EOL>* We never sell cards with a hole drilled in the center of the deck.<br /> <EOL>* Our canceled casino cards are always in excellent condition.<br /> <EOL>* We do not recommend using these cards in live cash games as there is always a possibility of a card being damaged, missing, or marked in some manner.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 2.5 x 3.5 inches",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56047,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Used Casino Playing Cards,,1.300,,Friday 13 June 2014 04:43:38 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312570,CSP-50-0102,mohammad,Casino Supply Stud Poker Card Guard Protector,Casino Supply Stud Poker Card Guard Protector,0.160,6.850,0,,"* Beautiful metal two sided full color Stud Poker Card (Guard) Protector.<br /> <EOL>* This is a heavy (weighs almost 3 oz.) 2 inch diameter card protector enclosed in a 2 3/4 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker.<br /> <EOL>* A card protector is an item that is placed on top of cards at a card game and protects them from accidentally being ""mucked"".<br /> <EOL>* What does ""muck"" mean?<br /> <EOL>* In poker, mucked cards are those folded and thrown back to the dealer, or into a pile of cards that have been folded by other players.<br /> <EOL>* If your hand is accidentally mucked, your hand is dead.<br /> <EOL>* You can't retrieve it from the pile of mucked cards.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>How does one use it?</b><br /> <EOL>* If you look at your cards immediately after them being dealt, place your protector on top of your cards whether you're going to play the hand or not.<br /> <EOL>* If you only place your protector on your cards when you have good enough cards to play, you'll be ""telling"" your opponents that you have good cards when your protector is on your cards and you have bad cards when you don't put the protector on your cards.<br /> <EOL>* If you are a player that waits until your turn to look at your cards, after you've been dealt your cards, you should place the protector on top of the cards, this will keep the dealer from thinking you have folded and/or mucked your cards.<br /> <EOL>* After you look at your cards, and decide to play, put your protector back on top of your cards.<br /> <EOL>* If you do no play, simply muck your cards and wait till the next hand.<br /> <EOL>* When not actively looking at their hand cards, players must place them face down on the table in front of their chips.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the coin over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* Hold'Em, Omaha, Stud and other poker players can use this product to secure their cards during play.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,6.990,,Friday 13 June 2014 10:58:36 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,5.140,63,N,222,Casino Supply
314594,CSP-55-5025,mohammad,Casino Supply Suit Yourself Casino Party Table Cover: 54 x 102 Inches,Casino Supply Suit Yourself Casino Party Table Cover: 54 x 102 Inches,0.240,4.690,0,,"* Our Suit Yourself Casino Party Table Cover has the look of Vegas while protecting your table.<br /> <EOL>* This quality Casino Party Table Cover will complement your casino night or card party event and make cleanup a winning proposition.<br /> <EOL>* Casino Party Table Cover features hearts, diamond, clubs and spades pattern.<br /> <EOL>* These table Covers are the perfect addition for your party.<br /> <EOL>* This is an easy way to add style to your casino night event.<br /> <EOL>* This package contains 1 table cover made in the USA, measuring 54 x 102 inches.<br /> <EOL>* Look for our coordinating tableware, decorations, invitations, and more (sold separately).",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56060,Casino Supply/More/Casino Party Decorations,,5.100,,Friday 27 June 2014 06:05:59 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.750,63,N,222,Casino Supply
