312573,CSP-32-0000,mohammad,Casino Supply Top Gun Brass Poker Card Guard Protector,Casino Supply Top Gun Brass Poker Card Guard Protector,0.080,5.850,0,,"* This is our premium quality 2 sided gold plated, solid brass Top Gun Card Guard Protector.<br /> <EOL>* This 1.625 inch diameter card guard protector is enclosed in a 2 inch clear acrylic non-yellowing protective airtight case to keep the coin in perfect condition as you use it while playing poker and will never fade or wear during the life of this product.<br /> <EOL>* The eye-catching colorful artwork is HAND PAINTED in color on each piece, giving it a one-of-a-kind quality.<br /> <EOL>* Positioning the card guard over the cards protects them from being accidentally exposed, fouled or folded.<br /> <EOL>* Your competitors won't get lucky and see your cards flip over because your poker hand will be protected!<br /> <EOL>* The perfect gift for any poker fan!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55998,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Guards,,4.780,,Friday 13 June 2014 11:07:50 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.510,63,N,222,Casino Supply
314665,CSP-50-4143,ariel2,Casino Supply Toy Slot Machine Bank,Casino Supply Toy Slot Machine Bank,0.710,9.850,0,,"* This is an affordable realistic Slot Machine Bank.<br /> <EOL>* Includes plastic coins of various sizes for playing and has an easy coin release for replay.<br /> <EOL>* The slot machine makes a fun and entertaining table centerpiece for any casino night event.<br /> <EOL>* This mini slot machine coin bank replicates details of a Las Vegas slot machine: a lever, spinning bars and two coin slots; a rear one for saving coins, and a front one for inserting the included plastic coins.<br /> <EOL>* You simply pull the side lever just like a rel slot machine and win with combinations of bars or 7s.<br /> <EOL>* Fun for kids of all ages.<br /> <EOL>* Not a gambling device and sold as a table decoration or bank.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 6 inches tall x 5 inches wide x 4 inches deep.",,999989,3,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56061,Casino Supply/More/Slot Machine Banks,,10.630,,Friday 27 June 2014 10:07:42 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,7.880,63,N,222,Casino Supply
312466,CSP-15-4001TreasureIsland,shahmuhammad,Casino Supply Treasure Island Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,Casino Supply Treasure Island Cancelled Casino Playing Cards,0.220,1.350,0,,"* These Cancelled Casino Playing Cards are a great value and are the same cards used in major casinos.<br /> <EOL>* Casino cards are usually changed every 8 hours or less - regardless of use.<br /> <EOL>* After they are removed from the casino tables, they are sorted, counted, and ""cancelled"" discretely by a cutting two opposite corners (to prevent cheating). <br /> <EOL>* We never sell cards with a hole drilled in the center of the deck.<br /> <EOL>* Our canceled casino cards are always in excellent condition.<br /> <EOL>* We do not recommend using these cards in live cash games as there is always a possibility of a card being damaged, missing, or marked in some manner.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 2.5 x 3.5 inches",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56047,Casino Supply/Playing Cards/Used Casino Playing Cards,,1.300,,Friday 13 June 2014 04:47:19 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.950,63,N,222,Casino Supply
