315130,CSP-31-2604RED,mohammad,"Casino Supply Trick Dice 7-11: Only 5,5,5 & 2,2,6 & (2), Regular","Casino Supply Trick Dice 7-11: Only 5,5,5 & 2,2,6 & (2), Regular",0.040,4.750,0,,"* 7-11 Trick dice.<br /> <EOL>* Now you can always win.<br /> <EOL>* Any dice game getting a 7 or 11 every roll with these TRICK DICE.<br /> <EOL>* You can play jokes on your friends or even perform magic tricks with these Always roll a winner with the special dice 7 or 11 is guaranteed on every throw.<br /> <EOL>* This set consists of (2) regular 5/8 dice, (1) with numbers 5, 5, & 5 and (1) with numbers 2, 2, & 6.<br /> <EOL>* For Amusement Only",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56058,Casino Supply/More,,6.460,,Sunday 29 June 2014 09:35:58 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,4.750,63,N,222,Casino Supply
