314300,CSP-50-0093,mohammad,"Casino Supply Two-Tone Suited Speed Cloth: Blue, Sold per Running Foot","Casino Supply Two-Tone Suited Speed Cloth: Blue, Sold per Running Foot",0.500,4.250,0,,"* Two-Tone Suited Speed Cloth is just what you need if you're building a new poker table or cleaning up your old one.<br /> <EOL>* Our Two-Tone suited Speed Cloth is 100% polyester and totally waterproof and stain resistant.<br /> <EOL>* The tight weave pattern lets your cards fly across the table with the greatest of ease.<br /> <EOL>* This is the best speed cloth we've ever offered and we've got it at a great price too!<br /> <EOL>* Made for long-term use and suitable (pun intended) for professional poker rooms.<br /> <EOL>* Our Two-Tone Suited Speed Cloth features the popular Heart, Diamond, Club, Spade pattern repeated in 1 inch squares across the surface of the cloth.<br /> <EOL>* It's not likely you'll be drinking while playing cards, but if you somehow do spill your drink, this two-tone speed cloth is totally waterproof with Teflon coated backing.<br /> <EOL>* Spills just bead up on the surface of the cloth.<br /> <EOL>* It cleans up easily without any fuss or mess.<br /> <EOL>* We sell the cloth by the ""running"" foot and the roll measures 59 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* Simply measure the length of your table and add a foot to allow some extra material to wrap around the edges when installing.<br /> <EOL>* If your table is 8 feet long, order a 9 foot piece of cloth.<br /> <EOL>* The total size will be be 59 inches, by whatever length (in feet) you order.<br /> <EOL>* If you order ""9"", you'll get a piece of two-tone suited speed cloth 9 feet long x 59 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* If you're building a lot of tables, we offer full rolls too.<br /> <EOL>* Full rolls measure 150 feet long and are sold at a 10% discount.<br /> <EOL>* PLEASE NOTE: Because this product is cut to order, returns are not allowed.<br /> <EOL>* If you are unsure if this is the right poker cloth for you, give us a call and we will happily send a sample swatch in the mail.",,999993,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56059,Casino Supply/More/New Items,,4.340,,Wednesday 25 June 2014 07:01:52 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,3.190,63,N,222,Casino Supply
