313106,CSP-50-0039,mohammad,Casino Supply Volara Game Table Foam Padding: 12 Inches Wide,Casino Supply Volara Game Table Foam Padding: 12 Inches Wide,1.500,0.650,0,,"* Volara Game Table Foam Padding (12 inches wide) is a flexible closed cell gaming table polyethylene foam padding, offering aesthetic appeal as well as an outstanding range of performance characteristics as a closed cell foam.<br /> <EOL>* This is the highest quality padding available for game tables.<br /> <EOL>* It is manufactured as a continuous smooth sheet with small cells.<br /> <EOL>* The smooth surface of this closed cell foam padding offers an extremely soft, smooth, nonabrasive and pliable surface with excellent consistency, gauge control, superior physical properties and low water absorption.<br /> <EOL>* Volara is used as a cushioning under the table layout or extra padding under the rail.<br /> <EOL>* You then cover the foam with your material of choice (vinyl, cloth, leather, etc...) to create the desired effect.<br /> <EOL>* It is sold per 12 inches wide by any length up to 300 feet long and is normally used for extra padding under the table rail.<br /> <EOL>* This is not used for table foam padding as it is only 12 inches wide.<br /> <EOL>* It is available in continuous rolls of up to 300 foot lengths.<br /> <EOL>* Please see item 50-0038 if needing 60 inch widths.<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Details:</b> <br /> <EOL>* Volara Type AFR<br /> <EOL>* Density: 2<br /> <EOL>* 12 Inches Wide<br /> <EOL>* 1/4 Inch Thick<br /> <EOL>* High Resiliency<br /> <EOL>* Smooth Surface<br /> <EOL>* Low Compression Set<br /> <EOL>* 100% Recovery Rate<br /> <EOL>* Water Repellent<br /> <EOL>* Fire-Retardant<br /> <EOL>* Non Toxic: Contains No CFC, HCFC, or Hydrocarbon Blowing Agents",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56032,Casino Supply/Table Supplies/Table Foam,,0.680,,Wednesday 18 June 2014 06:55:57 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,0.490,63,N,222,Casino Supply
