312357,CSP-50-0063,ariel2,"Casino Supply Wool Casino Poker Table Layout Cloth: Blue, Sold per Running Foot",Casino Supply Wool Casino Poker Table Layout Cloth: Blue,0.500,8.850,0,,"* This is a very high grade Wool Casino Poker Table Layout Cloth which is a heavy 21oz. having 80% wool, 20% nylon blend.<br /> <EOL>* While it comprises a small portion of your total table cost outlay, the fabric you choose is absolutely critical to your game.<br /> <EOL>* The cloth that overlays your game table must enhance its surface, and never get in the way of your game.<br /> <EOL>* Quality wool table cloth comes in various density, weights, and materials, not to mention every color under the sun.<br /> <EOL>* Poor quality cloth, the type most often installed on low end game tables consists of polyester, or some wool and nylon woven with very low density or open stitching.<br /> <EOL>* Because of the quality of the material and the low density this cloth burns easily and wears out very quickly.<br /> <EOL>* Our cloth is smooth sliding for easy dealing and very durable and long lasting.<br /> <EOL>* This wool blend material is sold by the running foot (60 inches wide x 12 inches long). <br /> <EOL>* Ships in one single piece up to 150 feet long.<br /> <EOL>* Non-returnable.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,55996,Casino Supply/Shop by Game/Poker Supplies/Poker Table Cloth,,9.030,,Thursday 12 June 2014 10:03:52 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2993,,6.640,63,N,222,Casino Supply
